{"data":{"body":"**P2 \u2014 Do not make MDC snapshot failures terminal workflow failures.** Passing `this::finishFailure` causes an ordinary exception from `MDC.getCopyOfContextMap()` to produce durable `FAILED` before hooks or user code run. A transient or faulty logging adapter can permanently terminate valid work. Treat capture as best-effort with a safe clearing fallback, or propagate it for invocation retry instead of serializing a terminal response.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc77Nu8Z","finding_digest":"0133ad3d67132cc709d324b4bff21ae1d7ecb80233125efebfc5cabeb0237650","finding_id":"arf_v1_aez22plhcmwmocotes2l74q24h","finding_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::supplyhandler::mdc-capture-failure-classification","identity_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::supplyhandler::mdc-capture-failure-classification","line":132,"observation_digest":"5dff61149faa4a3542b8d185b2010d17634d2ac5416aaadf4143fbb13029b0a7","observation_id":"aro_v1_lx7wcfe7vjfdkqvy2gc3eainc5","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/DurableExecutor.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_aez22plhcmwmocotes2l74q24h","published_at":"2026-10-08T04:30:58Z","review_id":"arr_v1_gznuwbdoezgdubsa2zuhlunkko","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"880c672b694dd6e9859596872447c03fb779d522","reviewer":"codex","start_line":132,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_uqzqffift6jbtff6meexgb6iba","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-08T04:30:58Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
